Considered to be one of the best educational systems in the world, the Swedish school system brings out different approaches to teaching and pedagogical methods. How does one international school with an IB programme fit into it? You can find out in our new episode with Caroline Darling; dive instructor, yoga teacher and Deputy Head at Dibber International School Sollentuna in Stockholm.

